Carnivore-Style "Shio" Beef Tongue (Gyutan)

**Summary:** 
Tender, fatty beef tongue seasoned with sea salt and seared to perfection. A high-fat, zero-carb Japanese BBQ staple.

* **Difficulty:** Easy
* **Prep Time:** 10 mins
* **Cook Time:** 5 mins
* **Servings:** 2

---

### **Nutrition (Per Serving)**

| Calories | Protein | Fat | Carbs |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
